    "user_request_original": "Design a 20-layer dielectric thin-film stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (20 coating layers total). Initialize layers 0-3 (first 4 layers) to quarter-wavelength optical thickness at 1547.5 nm center wavelength (HfO2: n≈2.05, target physical thickness ~189 nm; SiO2: n≈1.46, target physical thickness ~265 nm). Allow all 20 layer thicknesses to be optimized by gradient-based optimizer with bounds 50-400 nm. Evaluate coherent plane-wave transmittance and reflectance across 400-700 nm and 1530-1565 nm bands at normal incidence. Objective: maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band while maximizing reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 30.",
